  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rennovation of the J&#xe1;n Koll&#xe1;r elementary School in Selen&#x10d;a</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">V&#xfd;mena okien na &#x161;kole v Selen&#x10d;i</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The replacement of windows at the J&#xe1;n Koll&#xe1;r primary school in Selene&#x10d; aims to improve the material and technical conditions for teaching pupils and thus contribute to the improvement of the educational process at the school. Achieving technical and hygienic standards, improving the educational environment and energy efficiency of the school building will be achieved.&#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;V&#xfd;mena okien na z&#xe1;kladnej &#x161;kole J&#xe1;na Koll&#xe1;ra v Selen&#x10d;i m&#xe1; za cie&#x13e; zlep&#x161;i&#x165; materi&#xe1;lno-technick&#xe9; podmienky pre v&#xfd;u&#x10d;bu &#x17e;iakov a prispie&#x165; t&#xfd;m k skvalitneniu vzdel&#xe1;vacieho procesu na &#x161;kole. Dosiahne sa splnenie technick&#xfd;ch a hygienick&#xfd;ch noriem, zlep&#x161;enie vzdel&#xe1;vacieho prostredia a energetick&#xe1; efekt&#xed;vnos&#x165; objektu &#x161;koly.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
